{"version":1,"content":"<p>美俄達成柴油協議後，運載首批約3萬桶（約佔美國市場日均消耗量7%）俄羅斯柴油的油輪已駛離距第二大城市聖彼得堡約137公里的港口，到周五（23日）已離開芬蘭對出海域，預定開往美國紐約。</p><p>這亦是自2023年7月以來，首批輸往美國的俄國柴油。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:26.866261+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:20:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:38:08.891755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.843955+00:00","content_hash":"67a5586e7f76bae78290ca2b18da8e505db95d8478e86719ab96c7ff328529c3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}